{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@preconcurrency","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"compactMap","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"ElementOfResult","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":">(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"transform","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@Sendable","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"@escaping","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Element","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncSequence\/Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci7ElementQa"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"async","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ElementOfResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE10compactMapyAA012AsyncCompactC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__Sg7ElementQzYaclF0G8OfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"text":"?) -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncCompactMapSequence","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncCompactMapSequence","preciseIdentifier":"s:12_Concurrency23AsyncCompactMapSequenceV"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", ","kind":"text"},{"text":"ElementOfResult","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sci12_ConcurrencyE10compactMapyAA012AsyncCompactC8SequenceVyxqd__Gqd__Sg7ElementQzYaclF0G8OfResultL_qd__mfp"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"A mapping closure. ","type":"text"},{"code":"transform","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" accepts an element","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"of this sequence as its parameter and returns a transformed value of the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"same or of a different type.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"transform"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Return Value","type":"heading","anchor":"return-value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An asynchronous sequence that contains, in order, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"non-"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" elements produced by the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transform"},{"type":"text","text":" closure."}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method to transform every element received from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a base asynchronous sequence, while also discarding any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" results"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the closure. Typically, you use this to transform from one type of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"element to another."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In this example, an asynchronous sequence called "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Counter"},{"type":"text","text":" produces "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"values from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"1"},{"type":"text","text":" to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"5"},{"type":"text","text":". The closure provided to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"method takes each "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Int"},{"type":"text","text":" and looks up a corresponding "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"String"},{"type":"text","text":" from a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"romanNumeralDict"},{"type":"text","text":" dictionary. Because there is no key for "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"4"},{"type":"text","text":", the closure"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" in this case, which "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"compactMap(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" omits from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transformed asynchronous sequence."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let romanNumeralDict: [Int: String] =","    [1: \"I\", 2: \"II\", 3: \"III\", 5: \"V\"]","    ","let stream = Counter(howHigh: 5)","    .compactMap { romanNumeralDict[$0] }","for await numeral in stream {","    print(numeral, terminator: \" \")","}","\/\/ Prints \"I II III V \""],"syntax":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncCompactMapSequence\/compactMap(_:)-2zfm7","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/asynccompactmapsequence\/compactmap(_:)-2zfm7"]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"abstract":[{"text":"Creates an asynchronous sequence that maps the given closure over the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"asynchronous sequence’s elements, omitting results that don’t return a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"value.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/AsyncCompactMapSequence"]]},"metadata":{"extendedModule":"_Concurrency","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"compactMap(_:)","platforms":[{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iOS","introducedAt":"8.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"iPadOS","introducedAt":"8.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"deprecated":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst","introducedAt":"13.0"},{"unavailable":false,"beta":false,"